#: src/preferences/pages/general.ui:11
msgid ""
"Windows get the corners, border, outline, shadow and margin of libadwaita "
"windows, in each state: normal, maximized, tiled and fullscreen. Change them "
"in ~/.config/gtk-4.0/gtk.css and every window follows, live. libadwaita apps "
"are left alone, since they already draw them."
msgstr ""

#: src/preferences/pages/general.ui:16
msgid "Tweaks"
msgstr "Hienosäädöt"

#: src/preferences/pages/general.ui:19
msgid "Hide effects while moving or resizing"
msgstr ""

#: src/preferences/pages/general.ui:20
msgid ""
"Hide borders, rounded corners and shadows during the operation, then fade "
"them back together when it ends"
msgstr ""

